{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/teycujvqccjo1i8aq3pm35gfwnkjz1w.mp3","text":"你手上的设备好像运行得不太稳定，可以让我看一下吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/oni9l78xhcoxzqcuigsy64e101luvq9.mp3","text":"呀，安赛尔，卡缇看上去挺精神的呢。需要我帮你做什么吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/26/d0rcw6xoch11pd4tc0cbege0bcg5vh2.mp3","text":"我们队里的每个人都很有趣，特别是玫兰莎。虽然她好像总是躲着我，不过我总能感受到她散发的香味。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/nn3wwffxss39xy2vmybz6q8pwxrgw3g.mp3","text":"卡缇，你在干什么？看上去很开心的样子。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/tmw8byxa8ntpo344j8k51af6aokfjmj.mp3","text":"并不是每个拉特兰人都有使用铳的权力，因为铳对我们来说是不可多得的武器。在我的故乡，仿制铳部件的技术倒是很发达，制造弩的技术也在同步发展。这把装配了战术鱼骨的弩，就是这种技术的成果。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/1vnztvucnxd9eccl3zazcc273auezwr.mp3","text":"您要尝尝我的手制甜点吗？说来有点不好意思，我只能做25种甜品，真是一个不合格的拉特兰人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/sf4vidqurpvefvk9syilyf55bt5wpcx.mp3","text":"这枚天使的轮环？我也不知道为什么，它的位置会偏移。凯尔希医生说，这似乎和大脑海马体异常有关。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/65/d0c30a9b6ot3df9eac5wq9ibesktg8i.mp3","text":"与其站在远处眺望着博士，不如和博士您站在一起，这样我会更加开心。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/o1kgg8ygd8d6bx8v9u6b1vt6cvnw6jv.mp3","text":"博士，休息时的容貌，也这样令人印象深刻。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/s15oyc4r3evu50rvenr636fk40ezq1o.mp3","text":"我是拉特兰出身，担任狙击干员的安德切尔。虽然我还没有得到铳的使用权，不过说到弩的灵活运用，我不会输给前辈们的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/4g8i9oythk3c1qqzf0cbbwyfve5lhqc.mp3","text":"能被您这样重用，我很满足了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/lmmtck1hk6opoz3hccfq2xosv28wqc9.mp3","text":"非常感谢您的提拔。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/sm0k8dd24liq0zvpwnx8i327ao37jfh.mp3","text":"没问题的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/tgi7jvg8d2cnar2fhkihfixcl702nb3.mp3","text":"如果有东西坏掉了，可以让我看一下，也许能帮你修好的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/5m6q5zcjysajb8ylezbp1bh0c0i8qro.mp3","text":"出发时间到了，准备好了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/q53fuzldm5hapuokxqduk593s14zewg.mp3","text":"各位，开始狩猎吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/oy5fc1e13ar9l36fj1whgj9e491twg8.mp3","text":"遵从您的指示。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/68/nu9fp2nxp511spbap7op7vazz2wvbzr.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/szbuezlfzztr0mpbzzum52lj5uooxwv.mp3","text":"早点逃走比较好哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/54/lrjyyr7qtb741l6upwuht1i1xzytbd1.mp3","text":"好的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/b39v4y0veqfosy7bplowp4ys303ekoj.mp3","text":"这个！","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/82/0kviwz7nbm8agcdsjmnztheasquptuz.mp3","text":"锁定！","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_026.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/gczzd2j71f7231d4nzm5qbnniy2brx2.mp3","text":"一切都在博士的掌控中哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/ciwmsedslsdzu43og6op6y3vvkcezbe.mp3","text":"多亏有博士的指挥。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/38wmna38i6yfcwv96fiajerxmu3dym9.mp3","text":"虽然作战成功了，但好像还有什么地方不太对劲......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/3xq0xkbj67k6p9eemb1f71p519l1omx.mp3","text":"非常，非常抱歉......","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/d0dupab0wb7cio8w1y52rqhzvm3sos9.mp3","text":"这里的气氛真不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/bm70jwnu8sm4ee9p7jjn7xp90hpg5qt.mp3","text":"哎呀？","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/rov9aatblyrqtm7atgxyo8n33emo49v.mp3","text":"博士？能和您在一起，我也很开心。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/ouwbavb0ewfpetx9zj1r1p90mmcim74.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/o39mde5gtl3oa6hz9n173hpfgpameus.mp3","text":"在拉特兰，这一天大家也都会聚在一起庆祝，有些朋友还会专门过来探望，看看我的光环有没有变正。可惜，那时我最后也没能获得自己的铳，不过好像反而在弩上开了窍，蛮厉害吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/dkfanf60xt4r7aff5c2uisosmqwhjha.mp3","text":"愿上天祝福您，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_211_adnach/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/589feuv2y8j43ra3vq6c41n5chmun2s.mp3","text":"你手上的设备好像运行得不太稳定，可以让我看一下吗？","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/d4jnf9eem0rz3yvoznne9gpttco0mny.mp3","text":"呀，安赛尔，卡缇看上去挺精神的呢。需要我帮你做什么吗？","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/14/78spfnw4fwluo7l77sv29zjuwf9pnfc.mp3","text":"我们队里的每个人都很有趣，特别是玫兰莎。虽然她好像总是躲着我，不过我总能感受到她散发的香味。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/16/b7bvhj0hl5oyu9bi0wviysn1nbj6q3p.mp3","text":"卡缇，你在干什么？看上去很开心的样子。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/3p01ayg0yeabfavc1n5lyjfcroti7ln.mp3","text":"并不是每个拉特兰人都有使用铳的权力，因为铳对我们来说是不可多得的武器。在我的故乡，仿制铳部件的技术倒是很发达，制造弩的技术也在同步发展。这把装配了战术鱼骨的弩，就是这种技术的成果。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/t5wj6rfjwxyy83y2o5968ga9w734803.mp3","text":"您要尝尝我的手制甜点吗？说来有点不好意思，我只能做25种甜品，真是一个不合格的拉特兰人。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/16/2mq9yh9ahu645i6steeojso2dtbj54n.mp3","text":"这枚天使的轮环？我也不知道为什么，它的位置会偏移。凯尔希医生说，这似乎和大脑海马体异常有关。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/o9voxjrre8ed6oykzfzzabnss5ags1w.mp3","text":"与其站在远处眺望着博士，不如和博士您站在一起，这样我会更加开心。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/gcyvdgy7kxqyzjm5nx0n8rz0906yo20.mp3","text":"博士，休息时的容貌，也这样令人印象深刻。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/58mtoiqisivxcrooj0135u7ya886evu.mp3","text":"我是拉特兰出身，担任狙击干员的安德切尔。虽然我还没有得到铳的使用权，不过说到弩的灵活运用，我不会输给前辈们的！","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/5owm5cr1lh7ttkqfe8iyndeqckohflb.mp3","text":"能被您这样重用，我很满足了。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/c3ceupqbb3lzsa80ivfhs34vb153cfq.mp3","text":"非常感谢您的提拔。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/tub5i2yt0g31hftodsmgrlhr2g8gc8m.mp3","text":"没问题的。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/3o1q81xlr0cshxyft3t4iq0l6teoc80.mp3","text":"如果有东西坏掉了，可以让我看一下，也许能帮你修好的。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/scpwetdshcrjeqiaxuc5h19kbwd99wd.mp3","text":"出发时间到了，准备好了吗？","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/fblqr99ys0hzty2z1uqufrrslywv21q.mp3","text":"各位，开始狩猎吧。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/o0mpol4n8c1zxo3i8c6x382b46pa6g8.mp3","text":"遵从您的指示。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/jotl58sp87bqn1cih42b6ggpufbtqje.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/kvraxarf75okrjbmbu4aw0dwdizrkk3.mp3","text":"早点逃走比较好哦。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/jlc0qeixxcrhkfikoge001us9w8hxdj.mp3","text":"好的。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/8okqt7z675ko011gxmdzn4vs3ok8b4q.mp3","text":"这个！","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/76/l2dvq0xg8741qa59ai8gb7nqo583oxj.mp3","text":"锁定！","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_026.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/b7yuovkvbaj0h7ubxvctqmsyu8nrar2.mp3","text":"一切都在博士的掌控中哦。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/7ud891khrdjdfa4nghpdjxrzbbua48f.mp3","text":"多亏有博士的指挥。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/jxh2t0iwiz1t9pafaee4mqesz9py8b5.mp3","text":"虽然作战成功了，但好像还有什么地方不太对劲......？","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/1zi6xe5tqttqsoqnja98q75apheucff.mp3","text":"非常，非常抱歉......","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/1fsu717qpoo6ekdqj7ygrhukhv8e8sk.mp3","text":"这里的气氛真不错。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/py4nezomhb8pau30uno9d68bet138sy.mp3","text":"哎呀？","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/qclcgn4egx07e5kshgzjzimgt4q0ph5.mp3","text":"博士？能和您在一起，我也很开心。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/11fhq3x8xdccd5dmlfss8hhu4rwl6gw.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/6i0jowqywpwq9wtvouogr6d6lwbo0bq.mp3","text":"在拉特兰，这一天大家也都会聚在一起庆祝，有些朋友还会专门过来探望，看看我的光环有没有变正。可惜，那时我最后也没能获得自己的铳，不过好像反而在弩上开了窍，蛮厉害吧？","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:4/48/6n2nexyqumeod00jax83c3edqjcrv16.mp3","text":"愿上天祝福您，博士。","alt":"voice/char_211_adnach/cn_042.mp3"}]}}